Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:06:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 138/143] config: enable the lockup detectors and sysrq

A sustained WireGuard transfer (~880 Mbps over iperf3) hangs the board.
It was reproduced four times, and every single time the gap between the
last line a 1 Hz logger managed to write and the next boot was exactly
14 seconds -- which is the sunxi watchdog (timeout=16 sec) resetting a
machine that stopped responding, not a power loss, which would be
instantaneous.

So the kernel hard-locks. The reason we have no trace whatsoever is that
every detector is off: SOFTLOCKUP_DETECTOR, HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR,
DETECT_HUNG_TASK and WQ_WATCHDOG were all unset, so the CPU wedges and
nothing is ever printed.

Turn them on. On arm64 without pseudo-NMI the perf-based hard lockup
detector is unavailable, so this gets HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR_BUDDY, where
each CPU watches another one -- which is what we need, since the lockup
takes the CPU down with interrupts disabled.

Also enable SOFTLOCKUP_DETECTOR_INTR_STORM (it names the interrupt that
is starving the CPU, and pulls in IRQ_TIME_ACCOUNTING), MAGIC_SYSRQ so
stack dumps can be requested over the serial console of a wedged board,
and PANIC_ON_OOPS with a 10 s timeout so an oops reboots instead of
leaving a half-dead system.

These stay on permanently: Debian and Ubuntu ship them for the same
reason, and a hang that leaves no evidence is far more expensive than
the detectors.

Co-Authored-By: AI Agent
---
 arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
index 948ff0a7a..07c8b2460 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
@@ -227,6 +227,8 @@ CONFIG_MTD_UBI=m
 CONFIG_MTD_HYPERBUS=m
 CONFIG_OF_OVERLAY=y
 CONFIG_ZRAM=m
+CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_LZ4=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_LZ4HC=y
 CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_LZO=y
 CONFIG_ZRAM_DEF_COMP_ZSTD=y
@@ -1054,6 +1056,11 @@ CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_DWARF_TOOLCHAIN_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_REDUCED=y
 CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_FS=y
+CONFIG_PANIC_ON_OOPS=y
+CONFIG_PANIC_TIMEOUT=10
+CONFIG_SOFTLOCKUP_DETECTOR_INTR_STORM=y
+CONFIG_HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR=y
+CONFIG_WQ_WATCHDOG=y
 # CONFIG_FTRACE is not set
 CONFIG_CORESIGHT=m
 CONFIG_CORESIGHT_LINK_AND_SINK_TMC=m
